flowchart TD
  GA[GitHub Actions] -->|OIDC| WIP[Workload Identity Provider]
  WIP --> WPool[Workload Identity Pool]
  WPool --> TSA[Terraform Service Account]
  TSA -->|Terraform Apply| TF[Terraform]

  TF --> ST[GCS Terraform State Bucket]
  TF --> GKE[GKE Cluster]
  TF --> SQL[Cloud SQL PostgreSQL]
  TF --> AR[Artifact Registry]
  TF --> IAM[IAM + Workload Identity Bindings]
  TF --> INFR[Ingress + Managed Certificate]

  subgraph Runtime on GKE
    WEB[Web Deployment]
    API[API Deployment]
    JOB[Ingestion CronJobs/Jobs]
    KC[Keycloak Deployment (Open Source IAM)]
    KBOOT[Keycloak Bootstrap Job]
    KCS[Keycloak Service]
    SEC[ConfigMaps + Secrets]
  end

  AR --> WEB
  AR --> API
  INFR --> WEB
  INFR --> API
  API --> SQL
  JOB --> API
  API --> SEC
  JOB --> SEC

  KC --> KCS
  INFR --> KCS
  KCS --> SQL
  KC --> SEC
  SEC --> KBOOT
  KBOOT --> KC
